{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3225300/extras/CM.png?t=1744463913\" /><strong>Crypto Mining is an engaging simulator where you become a miner and build your own &quot;Crypto Empire.&quot; </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Manage cryptocurrency mining, optimize space, purchase equipment, and analyze the market. </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Take risks, expand your business, and prove that you are a master in the world of cryptocurrencies!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3225300/extras/OnlineMarket.png?t=1744463913\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Order products directly from the manufacturer on the online market in order to get better performance.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3225300/extras/OfflineMarket.png?t=1744463913\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Buy products on the market if you want to save money but also get worse performance.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3225300/extras/OnlineCasino.png?t=1744463913\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>For gambling, there is a casino on the PC, which has such modes as: 21 points, Dice.We wish you success in winning all the money in the world!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3225300/extras/StockMarket.png?t=1744463913\" /><strong>Trade large crypto-currency giants such as: NETCOIN,ETH,BTC.Keep an eye on the price chart, and exit the deal when it's profitable, just for you!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.stea